    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eee40a7d69f06f35ed4462e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰……办到了……\n这样就不是嘴上说说，\n是真的世界最强……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba82ad5582eede5265621ef852d23d30abcfaf1e84bf1578546a8b4114d7b223",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5155b8e7028c35bd1b1fd9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有马纪念结束后・把热情带给世界！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e74ba5b24893c4fdf3cb707f2ec71760403c28ef3184ccaa0b8db259acfac329",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014312.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02a0c46bf7f07357b95922f5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰以成为世界最强为目标，\n降临在名为闪耀系列赛的擂台上了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "17366be4c58dea6ee3d3dd1c3b083182c6f47f784af36d89737fe99d5188a5f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3099cf909ba7fdf7c5197d43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了成为“世界最强的赛马娘”，\n在特别周及草上飞等\n实力坚强的同伴陪伴下──",
      "source_fingerprint": "685e79bba0c8f7bbd4d0b5f13c502eaf0c7d1f16c2c2b1076ad143da871d22cd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ba0e9dbc05954236495e83b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰对着辽阔天空呐喊，\n宣示她将在全世界展翅遨翔。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3bdfb022a745445fbecc7e73fdc96cfbc23a8beaa56200df2b48682f8f3f76",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:decc7504ab6d2b1c6f28fb5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82fffc71ea00a9083e9421a6c37b32b5e572d5b8cb7412526ba59ce8f1d481e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8600985812f1d3d08048f0dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周等人为了粉丝感谢祭，\n正在努力练习英雄秀。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5c335812249ed52c4944fdf6836887396ebd47916cfdf171aeda53dc1fa23f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e5894c6cba928f51e8a1297",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是神鹰因为要选择其他路线，\n所以态度冷淡地表示自己不会参加。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11f01108fcdd49dad5cee38b9c7ae972dd96a5501b3ee71ccbd6b9b82c862588",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e74767ec83b155913addc2a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，那其实只是为了吓唬大家的谎言！\n她突然闯进练习制造惊喜，\n让同期伙伴们吓了一跳。",
      "source_fingerprint": "109aaa548ca4e6b94adf854e9463fec0642228f388092234808a74b72f4daced",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10c64a8783e4a684ea95cbbb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰和大家一起享受\n练习英雄秀带来的乐趣。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20c132dbaa9b0b5d45f3fad0dc0f49a1ef0b4d695b9c7466636acf3cbc89a332",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92ff69024c81a688dcdbeba7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "重视惊喜和乐趣的“表演家”资质，\n是神鹰的父亲传授给她的重要宝物。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91d1f184ab960c5289807244d203098003bf4ebd835aa621723df5573e9a9c6a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d0df2286fe3896e9b80fc2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与同期一起扮演英雄",
      "source_fingerprint": "faf767b1e75cbf64d0c25a705829154d57e2b0d5064a8d4a948f99e2139e71f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ee62e6a13a4cc548497b843",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰为了准备“NHK英里杯”\n埋头不停奔跑。\n她有个非常大的烦恼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d2492eeddde818721d6257f795b696f5abd11ced30f35fe02ca125ab924b647",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4c9294779f29a588b333535",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那就是“没有参加同一场竞赛的竞争对手”。\n见到同期伙伴们互相切磋琢磨，\n她也迫切渴求着能有这样的对象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a25e35352d7549e71e50403823f6ccf1320068b30d2a9e59a210e851fc4cb0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c963fd44807de2db098c8cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她抱着一丝期望询问圣王光环\n是否愿意参加“NHK英里杯”，\n但对方却说这太强人所难，拒绝了她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb1aa259341594855cda7f23146491c8b9a12c17bc8d443bbce59e4e90780644",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00f61bd54a16727d62f758fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员看到这一幕后，\n心想就算只有一次也好，\n希望有机会能安排她与劲敌交战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16bb5fa8b327b31525be99cf8e35ecc5720ad26a68eec79d16cc5dc2dfaa5189",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f8f3e1a7b006ced1f1d10f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无所适从的斗志",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5e538bfede018e43e4f40653d5b71513c73658555b942264a1b131d4fc9ff9d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76476b91f0e173bb0d6835d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "失去自信的神鹰\n脱去象征自己的面罩，便不知去向了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8348255f62b73f7520a2743b3ccf03364d87f965681307f92378e9a390a27f00",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e8de53d65619e8fe878bad8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员虽然设法找到了神鹰，\n但她却郁闷地表示隐藏真面目、\n虚张声势奔跑的自己是个骗子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5503e4f3ee9d6b42bc7269b2d9a8e37731d628ec43289f601038592927aac38a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d88c2a02047c99a0a371f8e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员告诉神鹰，就算遮住面貌，\n她至今完成的那些事也都是真实的，\n并把面罩交给她。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347ac0d3267fbe294e31b49f6addf2ee43b30ef210d07b7d1d4c7ba858091810",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a185b1c0b5501863d2cb0fb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再加上连草上飞也给予她鼓励，\n使她鼓起勇气以自己的意志重新戴起面罩。\n……于是“怪鸟”就这么重生了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02c47e5dc54d80dc09c87a7d53c600c526624c140a6f57344c33363d38d815e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6044cb7ad26fc0f2b12e6341",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而且再次立志挑战“日本杯”的她，\n为了取得成功的垫脚石，\n决定把“宝冢纪念”当成目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cd030ca509a1335491f850880f4485fbaa2652c1bf2d7e63275b04090506197",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc2e92de994b7655c7f3b289",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "被脱下的面具",
      "source_fingerprint": "0744a8c84f3ca7f2dbb13f64a8589a5168afdff08cb5670893a2131066c0413a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6e546eec1cabe4415f8c649",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“夏季集训”期间，\n神鹰等人参加了\n在集训地举办的夏日祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3d0472cff5e4b4d5d36e2d213ecd167bbfa6f0fde9cbba6c88de9c23bb791e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25eb51ea4f892f478f211d92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其他赛马娘因为跳舞跳累了正在休息……\n只有神鹰一个人为了让大家开心\n而继续跳舞。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23cb16de01f8036ec99faad5456831eb042fcdf0fbf2e7a1c03dd825d2675b33",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e96b78d43330ef66d93b2df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在这时，神鹰领悟到\n无声铃鹿曾说过的\n只属于自己的“特别力量”是什么。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ab323c7ccd6133a8317468c9a022975559bb00b891f06ec07fc797ab449e4f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:374211a94cfcd13137d2f01f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "胜利和表演全都是为了带给人们乐趣……\n为了这个目的，无论面对什么情况\n都能努力。那就是只属于自己的“力量”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a06cd2221191769541f038d69d720e1fb236797be10d744fe4e7964a7a6be5e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7dd9d110f1ccde1226ed3fe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰的愿望是带给大家欢乐。\n她和训练员一起对着\n象征这个想法的面罩献上了祈祷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb0574fa72a0c79a462e2f70f2527f87f61f6d04c8c156c2b8a17923485c64b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f67ea9af4601abccd5d7119b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迈向明日的狂欢节",
      "source_fingerprint": "aed4cd23172493db4f80a45eed7bd820c2475cffcead5f5411e68e437364f107",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bcdf8cfd0f4469690d5de3c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "到了秋季……\n神鹰的盟友特别周和草上飞\n都成长茁壮，实力大增。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd33832deac95c444bcdeaa9f4375fd423b7667dea491e7f53574e5f9e2b002b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29ed3ed0ee167f96488586f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰与她们一起举办服务粉丝的\n特别演唱会，并在最后的谈话节目上\n对两人投下战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35d8cf6170c9ece15b1c45991736a6f70f1391eed98beba1ae2afa8872c39e67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cc4afc5b8a5a0ecc2195510",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在“日本杯”对上特别周、\n而“有马纪念”则是对上草上飞……\n神鹰分别与她们立下一决胜负的约定。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5498472603466a3461d61a43bbde16bd01c2cc662c890400c9048f061c0584c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58ebef49a56ab8e91a86a325",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了向观众呈现最棒的娱乐表演，\n三位赛马娘一致表示了自己的决心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd2da45ac2fefcf4c1b995391e52017756377c5898f2fa9e5e277b5a838fa571",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81f157cb998cd642eca80949",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宴会开幕！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a81ae3dc821b3f8a3c99aa6a399a77c4c1049600a3ec102a68072c4a4fec9395",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6315e9113b9a296b66423174",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经典级的春天结束了，\n“夏季集训”的季节终于到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5dc5e20c90b732446d440561f5e432ec1d32c1bd61bf9f569a17329d09ff644a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:605e221a8ca8ecc095075130",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不能再一直消沉下去。\n神鹰似乎转换了心情，决定既然要烦恼，\n也要选择开朗的烦恼方式。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b6d3cc2d6272d4f015c73731a98936e7281baa6af737885c04bfb9ddf956c8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1825898fc50b5e32909770e6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是她带着宠物鸟“曼波”，\n开始度过开朗愉快的夏天！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07e5ff7faabbe527337795dd68fdf410e7c2b5d3c8b9fd8899506d3a0099446a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c5d087301d562816bf9e00",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第2年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "225375376c5fdf8404800f01bfae8c6ed9a9204cddd553a5978ed5b2c0cbe9a7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15e6bbaaa21cd7e8e8355586",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "前来参加“夏季集训”的神鹰\n得知有个当地的人们\n会戴着面具跳舞的祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "10b6a40492c3e1081597894bb1158a25f3ed567fd8c9118fe60d8ebd45682532",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42ff2939aa234dc690242855",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神鹰在面具与跳舞这两件事上\n感受到假面舞会的精神，\n兴高采烈地说自己绝对要参加祭典。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cde1c3efa132bbee4c313d145bfec8c808d189da1129e002046afbe0fb707c2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86c442ab9c460a0b853b2e4f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然这场“夏季集训”出现\n意料之外的发展……但我与神鹰\n今年的热血“夏季集训”正式开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37a870f492789a55799ade415e75d3b569575b0ef2d191e8a399a18261414bd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:efaae5eb114d7f5f01e7dbe9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第3年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2018daecd587b3acd573214a2b2c9e4607f1262610f0ce7cb9324e673d98a91d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014407.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3025bea6aaece1b5049e596",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“出道战”当天。\n神鹰充满斗志地表示飞向世界的日子\n终于到来。但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a4849ed44e33503323538d7d29fec8ffc8b979472ec5cb529fa1947e1764724",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bf5e8f89e8681f708b38d5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发现国外记者并未蜂拥而至的她十分失望，\n但她还是很有干劲地说\n这是宣传自己的机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e8db3b89cde44697cf128cddb456fe2fd3f27bce74990f75828a7c5d9b72996",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd022d74a6f859cdda6126b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她收下来自后方同期伙伴们的加油声，\n为了在世界打响名号……\n展翅飞向了“出道战”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aa972e16bed3c9522f7e6aac24bb9452979256a42f869221d12697ac070280fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1014/storytimeline_501014408.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:290289d7187ddd076b7624f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
